OL,3,GNEWSAMajor new city road given the
OL,4,Ago-ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe construction of a major road in
OL,7,FLincoln has been given the go-ahead to
OL,8,Fbe built.
OL,10,FIt will run through the new
OL,11,FCharterholme housing development,
OL,12,Fconnecting the entrance on
OL,13,FSkellingthorpe Road with the new
OL,14,FTritton Road bridge.
OL,16,FMembers of City of Lincoln Council's
OL,17,Fplanning committee unanimously voted
OL,18,Ffor the plans at a meeting on
OL,19,FWednesday, in the hope that it will
OL,20,Faddress heavy congestion in the area.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
